        "@value": "The Patio is covered and will operate rain or shine. In the event of inclement weather, service and entertainment will be moved inside to Elements Restaurant. While we will do our best to deliver a memorable lakeside experience each night, we ask for your understanding if the weather forces us inside. We have your safety and comfort in mind.  "
